note contract 6 line 175: a part is allowed only as a call argument; a part elsewhere (here assigned
note to a name) is error 9 (erratum E8).
om2
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
p = part a 0 4
putd plen p
ret 0
end
